  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added thread-local weak lookup indexes (`resolve_chain_arc`, `patches_arc`, `patch_rings_arc`) in `crates/geometry/src/geometry/feature/index.rs`.\n- Removed per-triangle heap allocations in `digest_of` and hoisted lattice construction in `patches` and `patch_rings` inside `crates/geometry/src/geometry/feature.rs`.\n- Added `SHARED_FEATURES_CACHE` (`Weak<[Triangle]>`, cap 32) in `crates/app/src/model/geometry.rs` so repeated `features_of` reads skip `digest_of`.\n- Added non-cloning `toolpath_nonempty` and `toolpath_warning_count` in `crates/app/src/model.rs`, used them in `operation::stamp::status_of` and `browser_tree::op_row`, and added `History::revision_token` in `crates/app/src/commands/mod.rs`.\n- Switched `Arc<Features>` lookups in `crates/app/src/operation/{selection.rs, stitch.rs}`, `crates/app/src/pick/{face.rs, feature_sel.rs}`, and `crates/ui/src/{edge_pick.rs, interact.rs, state.rs}` to `*_arc` helpers.\n- Added `crates/ui/src/pick_highlight.rs` (`HighlightCache`) to resolve selected, hovered, and row-hovered outlines once per state change.\n- Added `crates/ui/src/pick_highlight_mesh.rs` to tessellate each highlight layer into one cached `egui::Shape::Mesh` in `pick_ink::paint` and `shell::viewport_panel`.\n- Added `crates/ui/src/frame_cache.rs` and `crates/ui/src/panel_cache.rs` on `State` to cache world vertices, cutting regions and outlines, toolpath overlay lines, non-transient `world::Scene` plus digest, Geometry chips, 3-2-1 datum checks, selection account, unresolved notes, operation status banners, and browser operation rows.\n- Review fix (`b654e0502`): `WorldVertsEntry` in `crates/ui/src/frame_cache.rs` keeps a `Weak<[Triangle]>` of the source facets, not a raw address. A released source cannot match, and its address cannot be reused while the entry holds the `Weak`. Dead entries are pruned on each lookup.\n- Added architecture decision record in `docs/decisions/2201-highlighter-frame-perf.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\n- On models with many chains or facets, `features_of` re-hashed triangle buffers and `resolve_chain` re-walked and split chains repeatedly during frame, highlight, and panel queries.\n- `pick_ink::paint` and `shell::viewport_panel` emitted two individual `Shape::LineSegment` shapes per projected segment per frame.\n- `world::collect`, `toolpath_lines`, `stamp::status_of`, `browser_tree::op_row`, `op_page`, and `geo_page` rebuilt and cloned vertices, outlines, warnings, and toolpaths on every frame even when inputs stayed unchanged.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nReal `1280x720` shell and `View3D` renders. Before is `1f15f98e7` (the PR base). After is `b654e0502`. The images are only on the fork's `pr-screenshots` branch.\n\n| State | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Selected edges | ![Before selected edges](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/3441230386b638c8bfd4478b8cb22b908ff25aad/2256/before-selected-edges.png) | ![After selected edges](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/3441230386b638c8bfd4478b8cb22b908ff25aad/2256/after-selected-edges.png) |\n| Hovered edge | ![Before hovered edge](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/3441230386b638c8bfd4478b8cb22b908ff25aad/2256/before-hovered-edge.png) | ![After hovered edge](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/3441230386b638c8bfd4478b8cb22b908ff25aad/2256/after-hovered-edge.png) |\n| Welded face | ![Before welded face](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/3441230386b638c8bfd4478b8cb22b908ff25aad/2256/before-welded-face.png) | ![After welded face](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/3441230386b638c8bfd4478b8cb22b908ff25aad/2256/after-welded-face.png) |\n\n## Tests\n\n- UI pinning tests in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/highlight_perf.rs` (`4 passed; 0 failed` in `camcraft-ui`):\n  - `three_selected_edge_pieces_draw_as_a_single_batched_highlight` (red on unchanged code)\n  - `selected_highlight_builds_once_at_selection_and_zero_times_across_orbit_idle_and_hover` (red on unchanged code)\n  - `selected_welded_patch_draws_as_batched_highlight_with_single_build` (red on unchanged code)\n  - `dense_45k_model_with_multiple_ops_and_many_limit_findings_stays_stable_across_frames` (red on unchanged code)\n- Vertex cache pins in `crates/ui/src/frame_cache_tests.rs` (review fix):\n  - `frame_cache::tests::world_verts_cached_does_not_reuse_stale_entry_after_source_release`\n  - `frame_cache::tests::world_collect_rebuilds_vertices_when_model_facets_are_replaced`\n  - Both fail when the key goes back to the raw `facets_ptr` address. Both pass on the fix.\n- Geometry unit tests in `crates/geometry/src/geometry/feature/index.rs` (`2 passed; 0 failed` in `camcraft-geometry`):\n  - `resolve_chain_arc_matches_uncached_for_chains_runs_singletons_and_missing`\n  - `patch_apis_arc_match_uncached`\n- Mutation 1: restoring `crates/ui/src/pick_ink.rs` from `upstream/main` failed all 4 `highlight_perf` pins (`0 passed; 4 failed`, `3 pieces must draw as 1-2 batched shapes, got 180`). Restoring the fix passed all 4 pins (`4 passed; 0 failed`).\n- Mutation 2: bypassing the cache hit returns in `crates/ui/src/pick_highlight.rs` (`resolved_selected` and `resolve_single_cached`) failed `selected_highlight_builds_once_at_selection_and_zero_times_across_orbit_idle_and_hover` (`0 extra builds on frame 0`, `left: 2`, `right: 1`). Restoring the fix passed all 4 pins (`4 passed; 0 failed`).\n- Gate on `b654e0502`: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` (batch fallback) passed all 10 steps (`0 failed`).\n- Clippy: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-geometry -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed with zero warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n- None (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Release-tier `SLOW_BINARIES` (`motion:finish3d`, `motion:pivot5d`, `motion:flow`, `app:center_cut_multiaxis`) skipped by `gate quick`.\n- Live GPU swapchain frame timing in a windowed OS session.\n- Integration with current `upstream/main`: the PR has code conflicts. Both sides changed the same logic (`features_of_shared`, `world::collect`, `selection::drive_chains`). The refresh happens at merge time.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nTouches the same files (whichever merges second refreshes):\n\n- `#2197` (`crates/ui/src/pick_ink.rs` adds `op_pick_locked` in `paint`, `op_page.rs`, `interact.rs`, `lib.rs`, `state.rs`, `tests.rs`)\n- `#2254` (draft; `geo_page::body`, `op_page::operation_page`, `shell::viewport_panel`, `world::world_verts` and `collect_parts`, `interact::collect_overlay`, `lib.rs`, `state.rs`, `tests.rs`)\n- `#2255` (draft stacked on `#2254`; `crates/ui/src/egui_app/world.rs`)\n- `#2185` (`world::world_verts` and `collect_parts`, `shell.rs`, `lib.rs`, `state.rs`, `tests.rs`)\n- `#1701` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/geo_page.rs` remove-button layout)\n- `#2136` (`crates/app/src/operation/stamp.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/geo_page.rs`)\n- Other open PRs touching shared files in different functions or tests: `#2253`, `#2239`, `#2192`, `#2187`, `#2182`, `#2150`, `#2149`, `#2146`, `#2134`, `#2110`, `#2096`, `#2092`, `#2090`, `#2078`, `#2077`, `#2068`, `#1996`, `#1931`, `#1798`, `#1738`, `#1689`, `#1330`, `#1209`.\n\nChangelog: Cache highlight geometry resolution, batch viewport pick highlights into single meshes, and cache unchanged per-frame scene and panel data.\n\nFixes #2201\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
